## 📋 Security Review & Recommendations

### **1. ERROR HANDLING ISSUES**

| Issue | Risk | Recommendation |
|-------|------|----------------|
| No centralized error handler | Stack traces may leak in production | Add error-handling middleware |
| No 404 handler | Default Express 404 may leak info | Add custom 404 handler |
| Synchronous error handling | Unhandled exceptions crash server | Wrap in try-catch or use async handler |

**Suggested addition:**
```javascript
// Centralized error handler (place after all routes)
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err.stack);
  // Don't leak error details in production
  const message = process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' 
    ? 'Internal server error' 
    : err.message;
  res.status(500).json({ error: message });
});

// 404 handler
app.use((req, res) => {
  res.status(404).json({ error: 'Not found' });
});
```

---

### **2. INPUT VALIDATION ISSUES**

| Issue | Risk | Recommendation |
|-------|------|----------------|
| No input validation | XSS, injection attacks possible | Validate all inputs |
| No request size limits | DoS via large payloads | Add body parser limits |
| No CORS configuration | CSRF, unwanted cross-origin requests | Configure CORS |

