|-------|------|----------------|
| No security headers | XSS, clickjacking, MIME sniffing | Use helmet.js |

**Suggested addition:**
```javascript
const helmet = require('helmet');
app.use(helmet());
```

---

### **4. RATE LIMITING ISSUES**

| Issue | Risk | Recommendation |
|-------|------|----------------|
| No rate limiting | DoS, brute force attacks | Add express-rate-limit |

**Suggested addition:**
```javascript
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');
